prop deepsound zone.radius=50

quest title=Aurelis Rising
quest intro=A drowned city in a volcano's caldera, an expedition camp on the rim and a temple with an old promise carved on it. Start at the camp.
# Chapter 1 - the rim
step reach|camp|1|Land at the expedition camp on the caldera's rim
step read|Archaeologist's journal|1|Read the archaeologist's journal
step open|Expedition dive locker|1|Gear up from the expedition's dive locker
step reach|watchtemple|1|Climb to the watch temple on the rim's highest islet
step read|Tablet of the sea-priests|1|Read the sea-priests' tablet by the altar
step open|Rim ruins box|1|Search the temple ruins for a pilgrim's offering box
# Chapter 2 - the drowned streets
step reach|agora|1|Dive into the caldera to the drowned agora
step open|Agora market basket|1|Sift a stone market basket on the agora's paving
step open|Agora urn|1|Break the pitch seal on an agora urn
step collect|story:crystal|1|Take the first crystal from the harbour temple's shrine
step collect|story:crystal|2|Find the second crystal under the canal bridge
step open|Expedition's lost barrel|1|Recover the barrel the expedition lost on its first dive
step reach|sluice|1|Find the tide sluice and turn its wheel to open the inner basin
step collect|story:crystal|3|Take the third crystal from the inner basin's shrine
# Chapter 3 - the gate
step reach|gate|1|Find the crystal gate at the foot of the drowned tower
step kill|Angler fish|1|Face the gate's guardian
step reach|thronehall|1|Set the three crystals in the gate and swim into the throne hall
step collect|story:crown|1|Take the crown from the drowned throne (breathe under the dome)
# Chapter 4 - rising
step reach|altar|1|Carry the crown back up to the watch temple's altar
step collect|story:priestkey|1|Lay the crown on the altar - and watch Aurelis rise
step open|Treasury of Aurelis|1|Swim to the risen tower and open the sea-priests' treasury
quest done=The tower of Aurelis stands in the air again for the first time in a thousand years, its treasury open to the sky. The rest of the city sleeps on below - but now it has a way back up.
quest reward=OxygenBottle*2;MetalIngot*8;Glass*8

save Aurelis
